    <!-- https://w3id.org/utt/def/eenheid -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/utt/def/eenheid">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Declares the unit in which values of the annotated datatype property
    are expressed. Values are QUDT unit individuals, so the unit itself is identified by a
    QUDT IRI and is machine resolvable.

    A local annotation property is used rather than a QUDT predicate for two reasons. First,
    qudt:unit is deprecated in QUDT 2.1 and marked dcterms:isReplacedBy qudt:hasUnit. Second,
    qudt:hasUnit relates a system of units to a unit, which is a different relationship from
    the one needed here. QUDT provides no predicate for annotating an owl:DatatypeProperty
    with the unit its values carry, because QUDT expects measurements to be reified as
    qudt:QuantityValue instances.

    UTT deliberately records plain xsd:decimal values rather than reified quantity values,
    since contractors supply flat numeric fields and reification would add a node per
    measurement for no practical gain. This property states the expected unit for producers
    and consumers of that data. It is documentation, not a quantity construction, and no
    reasoner will derive unit conversion from it.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="nl">eenheid</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">unit</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/Unit"/>
    </owl:AnnotationProperty>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/utt/def/pmklKleur -->


    <owl:AnnotationProperty rdf:about="https://w3id.org/utt/def/pmklKleur">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">RGB hex colour from the PMKL (Presentatiemodel Kabels en
    Leidingen) version 3.0 colour table, published at docs.geostandaarden.nl/kl/pmkl30/.
    Annotated on ThemaScheme individuals so the viewer renders utilities in the colour
    practitioners expect from KLIC maps.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PMKL colour</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="nl">PMKL kleur</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"/>
    </owl:AnnotationProperty>
    


